===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A small [[cup]], usually with a [[handle]], used for [[drinking]] [[tea]]; normally sits in a [[saucer]] as part of a [[tea set]].
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1886|translator=H.L. Br&aelig;kstad|author=Peter Christen Asbj&oslash;rnsen|authorlink=Peter Christen Asbj&oslash;rnsen|title=Folk and Fairy Tales|page=182|passage="There isn't wind enough to capsize a '''tea-cup''' in a gutter," said Rasmus, and shifted his chew of tobacco with a little black chalk pipe, while he looked around him on all sides.}}
# A unit of [[measure]]; a [[teacupful]].

